cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, or parts of its code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NDM Domain Health Check"
abstract: >-
  A single Bash script that audits a domain (registration, DNS, DNSSEC, web/TLS, mail,
  blocklists, IP ownership, CAA, Certificate Transparency) and prints a graded report
  that states the source of every value.
